ure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (definition-target contradiction sentence)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\bot_G\\coloneqq(0=S(0))\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\bot_G\\coloneqq(0=S(0))\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> : 选定的算术矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span></li>\n<li>一致性可通过“选定的矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span>不可证”来表达</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span>在标准自然数模型中为假；任何证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0\">\\(\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0\\)</span>的理论都可反驳它</li>\n<li>本定义只固定矛盾句；内部一致性句另见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-contradiction-—-Contradiction-$\\bot$","text":"df-contradiction — Contradiction $\\bot$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sen